      "url": "/en/adrs/grok-cad-adr/decisions/mui-for-ui",
      "content": "Grok CAD knowledge base Grok CAD RD CAD web app Conversation with Grok Web based CAD Tool CAD UIs are very \"desktop application\" like so MUI shines here AppBar + Toolbar top menubar AppBar position \"sticky\" color \" \" for the main title bar Inside Logo + Menu components for File Edit View Tools Help exactly like the menubar example you linked File menu → New Open Save Export STEP glTF STL Import Edit → Undo/Redo with keyboard shortcuts via useHotkeys View → Toggle side panels orthographic/perspective grid etc Toolbar icon strip under the menu Toolbar with IconButton + Tooltip for Select Line Rectangle Circle Extrude Revolve Fillet etc Group them with ButtonGroup or ToggleButtonGroup for modes sketch vs model vs assembly Drawer left right sidebars Permanent or Persistent Drawer on the left Feature tree browser layers Use MUI TreeView with TreeItem for the parametric feature history very common in CAD Right drawer Properties panel Paper + Accordion sections Dimensions Constraints Material Appearance Inside TextField Select Slider Switch ColorPicker MUI has one Autocomplete for references Dialog Modal File open/save dialogs options settings material library Snackbar + Alert \"Model regenerated\" \"Export successful\" errors from kernel SpeedDial floating action button For quick access to common tools on mobile/tablet nice to have Tabs if multi document Inside a tab bar for multiple open parts/assemblies Menu MenuList MenuItem Context menu on right click in viewport copy paste delete constraints Popover or Menu for dropdown tool options extrude depth presets Divider List ListItem Chip everywhere in side panels Backdrop + custom loading when regenerating heavy geometry Layout MUI Grid Top AppBar Left Drawer Center from R3F full height/width Right Drawer Bottom optional status bar custom with coords units etc"
