      "category": "Neurotechnology ADRs",
      "url": "/en/adrs/neuralink-bci-overcoming-serial-attention-limitation-adr/decisions/whole-brain-high-bandwidth-symbiosis-layer",
      "content": "NeuraLink BCI Overcoming serial attention limitation 1 Whole Brain High Bandwidth “Symbiosis Layer” Gigabit Scale Conceptual Telepathy Neuralink’ roadmap already targets megabit to gigabit throughput A mature version would like an LLM training loop applied to human experience Multiple cortical threads or future multi implant arrays simultaneously ingest raw data streams from any source — live YouTube channels feeds books papers podcasts An on board or cloud linked AI co processor parallel processes everything in real time exactly as modern large language models train on trillion token datasets The BCI then injects pre digested “concepts” directly into your semantic memory and working consciousness — not as sequential video/audio but as instantaneous understanding insight clusters or even simulated experiences Result you could “consume” 100 hours of content in subjective minutes with full retention and cross referencing while your primary attention remains free for creative synthesis Musk has explicitly described this as “uncompressed concepts” flowing between human minds and AI"
