      "category": "ADRs für Neurotechnologie",
      "url": "/de/adrs/neuralink-bci-overcoming-serial-attention-limitation-adr/decisions/merger-of-experiences",
      "content": "NeuraLink BCI Overcoming serial attention limitation 4 Full “Consciousness Forking” or Collective Super Consciousness Ultimate Horizon Experiences are later merged back with zero loss — exactly how transformer models run massive parallel attention heads and then integrate This would make the 24 hour constraint irrelevant subjective experience scales with compute not biology"
