      "content": "Starship Nano Assembly 1 Preparation and Feedstock Acquisition Raw Material Gathering Start with a \"feedstock reservoir\"—a vat or environmental extractor containing abundant elements like carbon from CO2 in the air or graphite iron from ore or recycled steel chromium and nickel for stainless steel alloys and trace elements for specialized components like engine nozzles Nanobots could disassemble nearby scrap metal soil or even atmospheric gases to harvest atoms using energy from solar panels or fusion reactors to break bonds"
