      "category": "ADRs für planetare Besiedlung",
      "url": "/de/adrs/terraforming-mars-adr/decisions/resource-production-and-colony-support",
      "content": "Terraform Mars in 10 years Resource Production and Colony Support Nanobots could convert regolith into O2 via electrolysis of extracted water and methane fuel from CO2 and hydrogen at rates orders of magnitude faster than MOXIE supporting propellant for trips or local energy Building materials like sintered bricks or 3D printed metals from microbially extracted iron could create habitats roads and greenhouses reducing Earth shipments by 90%+ This fosters self sustaining colonies where nanobots replicate to scale operations turning Mars into a resource hub"
